{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">泰國總理阿努廷再次在外交場合大展歌喉。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.SING-1300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026CoZCyXTyix1788416450.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.THAI.SING-1300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阿努廷周三會見到訪的新加坡總理黃循財，兩人在會議前同台表演，阿努廷唱起英國著名樂隊披頭四的名曲《Let It Be》，黃循財則彈結他伴奏。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.SING-1300.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263VudgNZZst1788416417.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.THAI.SING-1300.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這次並非阿努廷首次展現他的音樂才華。今年7月，阿努廷訪華期間出席午宴，獻唱著名歌星鄧麗君的代表作《甜蜜蜜》，國務院總理李強及其他嘉賓一同打拍子欣賞，被視為是開展「音樂外交」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T06:35:35.857065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}